Name:Rules pilot 484 - Promise the gift
Goal:Survive
Turns:1
Difficulty:Easy
Description:It is your first main phase. You have Blooming Blast (gift a Treasure; 2 damage to target creature, and if the gift was promised, 3 damage to that creature's controller) in hand with two red mana floating. The opponent is at 20 life and controls Grizzly Bears. Destroy the Bears and deal 3 damage to the opponent this turn.
Rule:authored-gift-promised-bonus | Gift is an optional additional cost: you choose an opponent to receive the gift as you cast the spell, and the extra effect happens only if it was promised (CR 702.174a): promise the Treasure and the Bears' controller takes 3
